   "Submit My Number-related documents to JASSO",
   "Receive the notice of selection as a candidate, then submit an enrollment report (進学届) after entering the institution",
   "Apply for tuition reduction or waiver at the office of the university or other institution attended",
   "Complete annual continuation procedures and eligibility reviews while enrolled"
